---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About — IELTS Corner"
  description="Learn about IELTS Corner, our mission to help students achieve their test score goals, and our approach to English teaching."
  type="page"
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: var(--s-6);">
    <div class="hero" style={`--hero-bg: url('/heroes/about.png');`}>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>About IELTS Corner</h1>
        <p>We help students get the test scores they need.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-8);"></div>

    <!-- ABOUT SECTION -->
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div>
        <h2>Our mission</h2>
        <p>Most students fail the IELTS and CELPIP because they don't learn the right things. They waste time on lessons that don't help their score.</p>
        <p>At IELTS Corner, we focus on what matters: the structures, words, and strategies that actually improve test scores.</p>
        <p>We believe every student can get Band 7+ (IELTS) or CLB 9+ (CELPIP). You just need the right lessons and the right practice.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="surface" style="padding: var(--s-4); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--accent-light);">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">What we offer</h3>
        <div class="stack" style="gap: var(--s-2);">
          <div>
            <strong>502 free lessons</strong>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Grammar, vocabulary, writing, and speaking lessons for all levels.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>1-on-1 tutoring</strong>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">CA$30/hour live lessons with personalized feedback.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Essay correction</strong>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">CA$15 per essay with detailed band-score feedback.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Comprehensive eBook</strong>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted);">$19.99 complete grammar and writing guide for IELTS/CELPIP.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

    <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->
    <div>
      <h2>Why students choose IELTS Corner</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <article class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">We focus on YOUR exam</h3>
          <p>All our lessons are for IELTS and CELPIP. We don't teach general English—we teach what you need to pass.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Clear, simple English</h3>
          <p>Our lessons are written for students like you. No confusing grammar jargon. Just clear explanations and examples.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Real examples and practice</h3>
          <p>Every lesson uses real examples from IELTS/CELPIP tests. You practice with materials that match the actual exam.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Organized by difficulty</h3>
          <p>Lessons are arranged from A1 (beginner) to C1 (advanced). Start where you are. Move at your own pace.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Quick and practical</h3>
          <p>No long boring videos. Our lessons take 5–15 minutes. You leave with one useful thing you can use immediately.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">One-on-one support</h3>
          <p>Want personal help? Book a tutor. Get individual attention. Get feedback on your writing. Be confident on test day.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

    <!-- APPROACH SECTION -->
    <div class="surface feature" style="padding: var(--s-5);">
      <h2>Our teaching approach</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div class="stack">
          <h3>1. Start with the structure</h3>
          <p>We show you the grammar structure or rule first. You see exactly how it works, with simple examples.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stack">
          <h3>2. Real exam examples</h3>
          <p>Then we show real sentences from IELTS and CELPIP tests. You see the rule in action from actual exams.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stack">
          <h3>3. Common mistakes</h3>
          <p>We show what students do wrong. You learn what NOT to do, so you avoid the mistakes others make.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stack">
          <h3>4. Practice and tips</h3>
          <p>Finally, we give you practice exercises and IELTS/CELPIP tips. You apply what you learned right away.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

    <!-- CONTACT SECTION -->
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <h2>Ready to get your score?</h2>
      <p>Start with our free lessons. If you want personal help, book a tutor.</p>
      <div class="cluster" style="justify-content: center; margin-top: var(--s-2);">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lessons">Explore lessons →</a>
        <a class="btn" href="/tutoring">See tutoring</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    }
  }
</style>
